  "title": {
   "en": "Isshun de Chiryou shiteita no ni Yakudatazu to Tsuihousareta Tensai Chiyushi, Yami Healer to shite Tanoshiku Ikiru Cresfall Sennyu-hen"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "The Brilliant Healer’s New Life in the Shadows (MangaToon)"
   },
   {
    "ja": "一瞬で治療していたのに役立たずと追放された天才治癒師、闇ヒーラーとして楽しく生きる"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Brilliant Healer's New Life in the Shadows (Minsam)"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Born a poor man in the slums, Zenos never had opportunities in life, so he decides to forge his own opportunities by teaching himself the curative arts after a chance encounter with a healer. \n\nWhen an adventuring party led by a man named Aston extends him an invitation, Zenos is elated — only to then be treated like dirt by his teammates. \n\nDespite Zenos’s diligent efforts to hone his skills to nothing short of perfection, the party deems him useless and kicks him out. Bereft of money and options, Zenos starts an illegal clinic and becomes a shadow healer. \n\nWord of his healing genius spreads quickly throughout the city’s underbelly, and as his reputation grows among the dregs of society, knowledge of Zenos’s esteem reaches the wrong ears."
  },
